sequenceDiagram
    participant Act as Activity (Ch 44)
    participant Singleton as Singleton (Ch 46)
    participant GC as Garbage Collector
    participant LC as LeakCanary (dev)

    Act->>Singleton: register listener / pass Activity Context (BUG)
    Note over Singleton: holds Activity reference - app-lived
    Act->>Act: onDestroy (rotation) - Activity SHOULD be freed
    GC->>GC: cannot collect - still reachable from Singleton (GC root)
    GC-->>LC: Activity retained after destroy
    LC-->>Act: reports LEAK + reference chain (Singleton -> Activity)
    Note over Act: FIX - applicationContext / unregister / WeakReference - Ch 46/44
